applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MORITA HIDEHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NOSE TETSURO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKAHASHI FUMIAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MORITA, HIDEHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NOSE, TETSURO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKAHASHI, FUMIAKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A ceramics sintered compact exhibiting low thermal expansion and high rigidity, characterized in that it has a crystal structure of hexagonal close packing and consists substantially of solid solution crystal grains represented by the formula: MgaLibFecAldSieOf wherein a ranges from 1.8 to 1.9, b ranges from 0.1 to 0.3, c ranges from 0 to 0.2, d ranges from 3.9 to 4.1, e ranges from 6.0 to 7.0, f ranges from 19 to 23.  Also disclosed is a ceramics sintered compact characterized in that it further has the lattice constants ranging as follows: a0 = 9.774 to 9.804  ANGSTROM , c0 = 9.286 to 9.330  ANGSTROM , and a relative density of 98 % or more.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un comprimé fritté en céramique à expansion thermique et rigidité élevées, qui se caractérise en ce qu'il présente une structure cristalline de compacité hexagonale élevée et qu'il consiste sensiblement en grains de cristal en solution solide, représentés par la formule : MgaLibFecAldSieOf, a étant compris entre 1,8 et 1,9, b entre 0,1 et 0,3, c entre 0 et 0,2, d entre 3,9 et 4,1, e entre 6 et 7, f entre 19 et 23. L'invention porte également sur un comprimé fritté en céramique se caractérisant en ce qu'il comporte, par ailleurs, les constantes de réseau suivantes : a0 = 9 774 à 9 804  ANGSTROM , c0 = 9 286 à 9 330  ANGSTROM , et en ce qu'il présente une densité relative de 98 % ou plus.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>